      "writtenOn": "2022-12-07T11:00:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do have that patch testing with upstream/, but somehow I can\u0027t rebase this on AOSP...\n\nThe issue is that there is no perfect policy and we haven\u0027t really settled with some golden rule to follow. Even if we separate them to two functions, we still have to deal with issues like receiving both requests at the same time (i.e., connect via UI while resolving a previous request initiated by the headset, and all sorts of chaotic permutations of profile connection/disconnection), and IMO considering them as a similar form makes it easier for us to focus on the core if we don\u0027t have any good assumptions/guarantees to establish on.",
